Salamander Grand Piano
Recorded by Alexander Holm.
Licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 (CC-BY 3.0).
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

Thirty samples, one every three semitones from A0 to C8, as distributed with
Tone.js at https://tonejs.github.io/audio/salamander/

These are the only recordings in this repository. Everything else here — every
other instrument, every generated movement, the reverb, the artwork — is
calculated at the moment you ask for it. The written scores in js/data/scores/
are pieces rather than repertoire, and a piece deserves the instrument it was
written for.
